    "body": "# What does this PR do ?\n\n - After `_finish_train` returns, setup_output and iterator aliases still retain DataLoader iterators and their workers.\n - Release these references before destroying the process group so workers exit during normal training shutdown.\n - Orderly worker exits give process-lifecycle and profiling tools a more complete record / metrics.\n\n# Changelog\n\n- Drop references before destroying the process group so PyTorch can stop the workers during normal shutdown.\n",
